service.description:
A reading of a draft inspection: a characteristic its template had when it was created, a sample from 1
            to the sample size, and the value (a measured value, whose pass is computed from the characteristic's limits;
            pass or fail; an observation). A reading saved again replaces its value (audit-logged). Refuses without
            QUALITY_INSPECT (PERMISSION_DENIED); an inspection outside the user's organizations or facilityIds
            (RECORD_UNAVAILABLE); one that is not a draft (INSPECTION_NOT_DRAFT); a characteristic not of it (ITEM_INVALID);
            another sample (SAMPLE_INVALID); no value (VALUE_REQUIRED) or a wrong one (VALUE_INVALID).
